<title>BELGIUM: Belgian yr/yr budget deficit narrows in February.</title>
<headline>Belgian yr/yr budget deficit narrows in February.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian federal state's net borrowing requirement narrowed to 31.4 billion francs in February from 49.3 billion in the year-ago month, the finance and budget ministries said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The cumulative borrowing requirement for the first two months of 1997 widened to 146.2 billion francs from 137.6 billion in the same period last year.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
